(6413495, 950775, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is such a great image, Deb.  I LOVE the tiny cars and people waaaaay in the distance, behind the solar veil.  But my favorite part of this image are the sunrays.  (That''s the best thing about phone cameras!)  Although the glow on the arrows is also killer.</td>', 'This is such a great image, Deb.  I LOVE the tiny cars and people waaaaay in the distance, behind the solar veil.  But my favorite part of this image are the sunrays.  (That''s the best thing about phone cameras!)  Although the glow on the arrows is also killer.', '2011-05-14 13:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6413496, 950025, 96751, '<td valign="top">Someone got shaved!!!  Fabulous, just adore this shot.  The high key bg is perfect for this image.</td>', 'Someone got shaved!!!  Fabulous, just adore this shot.  The high key bg is perfect for this image.', '2011-05-14 13:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
