(6413501, 949509, 96751, '<td valign="top">LOVE the scorched sky look.  There is something so incredibly pleasing about this image.  Maybe it''s the angle, or the colors, or the lines.  It looks sort of watermelon-y.  I want to lick it.</td>', 'LOVE the scorched sky look.  There is something so incredibly pleasing about this image.  Maybe it''s the angle, or the colors, or the lines.  It looks sort of watermelon-y.  I want to lick it.', '2011-05-14 13:59:16.000000', NULL, 1);
