(6418905, 951185, 39057, '<td valign="top">Not bad..the subject is great. There are some areas that look strangely out of focus. The greenish color to the bottom right looks strange. The same effect is seen on the left border about half way up. The trees don''t look like the "liked" to be sharpened !<br/> <br/>At first look I felt this could be a top 5. However, now that I''ve seen all, I''d say a top 20.<br/> <br/>I may change vote again after looking more closely at others.<br/> <br/>I moved this to an 8. I have several 10s and a couple of 9s.</td>', 'Not bad..the subject is great. There are some areas that look strangely out of focus. The greenish color to the bottom right looks strange. The same effect is seen on the left border about half way up. The trees don''t look like the "liked" to be sharpened ! At first look I felt this could be a top 5. However, now that I''ve seen all, I''d say a top 20. I may change vote again after looking more closely at others. I moved this to an 8. I have several 10s and a couple of 9s.', '2011-05-20 00:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
