(6424871, 951223, 102315, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kenskid:</b></div><hr/><i> 26 more hours for Jobu and then 3 more years to another ribbon !!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ye of little faith.</td>', 'Originally posted by kenskid: 26 more hours for Jobu and then 3 more years to another ribbon !!!   Ye of little faith.', '2011-05-26 00:20:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(6424893, 950745, 102315, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Nobody:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SEG:</b></div><hr/><i> You can take pictures with the iPad? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The ipad2 has two cameras, one forward facing, one rear. <br/> <br/>They are both very poor cameras, so I''m really pleased how well this did.   The original is less than one megapixel! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Oh wow. Cool. Great image too BTW.</td>', 'Originally posted by Nobody: Originally posted by SEG: You can take pictures with the iPad?   The ipad2 has two cameras, one forward facing, one rear.  They are both very poor cameras, so I''m really pleased how well this did.   The original is less than one megapixel!   Oh wow. Cool. Great image too BTW.', '2011-05-26 00:59:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6425222, 949850, 117037, '<td valign="top">Hi Cristy,<br/> <br/>Thank you for stopping by, it is a real car -Volkswagen Beetle type 1 (1952)- not a sculpture and belong to one of Indonesian old car collectors. When I saw it at the exhibition I wondered why the car can be bended like that, drew out my feeling to shoot it.<br/> <br/>I was lucky about the guy, he just passed by when I framed the pic with a little girl watching the car.<br/> <br/>Cheers,<br/>Galatia<br/>____________<br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ristyz:</b></div><hr/><i> I had to look at this for a while, very interesting sculpture for sure but the people in the background are the finishing touch. Glad you didn''t wait for them to clear out. </i></td></tr></table><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-05-26 13:42:30.</i></td>', 'Hi Cristy, Thank you for stopping by, it is a real car -Volkswagen Beetle type 1 (1952)- not a sculpture and belong to one of Indonesian old car collectors. When I saw it at the exhibition I wondered why the car can be bended like that, drew out my feeling to shoot it. I was lucky about the guy, he just passed by when I framed the pic with a little girl watching the car. Cheers,Galatia____________Originally posted by Ristyz: I had to look at this for a while, very interesting sculpture for sure but the people in the background are the finishing touch. Glad you didn''t wait for them to clear out. ', '2011-05-26 14:36:06.000000', '2011-05-26 14:42:30.000000', 0),
(6425267, 950422, 61961, '<td valign="top">Okay clarity and pretty flower, very good color.  I think this would have done better with a blue sky; white skies always look so over-exposed.  And in my opinion it would look better without the thick green frame!</td>', 'Okay clarity and pretty flower, very good color.  I think this would have done better with a blue sky; white skies always look so over-exposed.  And in my opinion it would look better without the thick green frame!', '2011-05-26 17:02:24.000000', NULL, 0),
