(6616545, 951020, 17507, '<td valign="top">I got thoroughly distracted from DPC and things photographic for a good while, so I''m just seeing this photo for the first time now. Belated but heartfelt: congratulations on the first-place position, on the excellent score, and, of course, for the compelling photograph and capturing the story that it tells (even without the benefit of your comments).</td>', 'I got thoroughly distracted from DPC and things photographic for a good while, so I''m just seeing this photo for the first time now. Belated but heartfelt: congratulations on the first-place position, on the excellent score, and, of course, for the compelling photograph and capturing the story that it tells (even without the benefit of your comments).', '2011-12-12 06:37:01.000000', NULL, 0),
